{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Roguelike Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in electrifying high-speed combat that combines dynamic attacks and over the top, slapstick violence. With each run, adapt and evolve your playstyle as you discover new part combinations and upgrades to dominate increasingly tougher foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Part-Swapping System:</strong> Customize Zippy with scavenged body parts, unlocking endless possibilities for strategy and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat:</strong> Dive into frantic, skill-based battles where every decision and every part counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Progression:</strong> Each run offers new challenges, upgrades, and surprises ensuring no two fights are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You got this!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365860/e7fc983baed32e80e32c762f76cbff11695f0cb8.jpg"},{"name":"Hammer Time!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365860/ebd5f1134f2f9e69dbebaa2b07d8eeafd58b0be4.jpg"},{"name":"Full Health! But at what cost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365860/eaf48ea59e5aeb70ee98e3e82fc8c92a24121450.jpg"},{"name":"SYSTEM_OVERRIDE_SUCCESSFUL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365860/17b716c4918dc0f5c4473b7465dd6c93c64bd341.jpg"},{"name":"Critical Healing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365860/e709ff2ff26e230064ed847b36824d075a972eba.jpg"},{"name":"Break-A-Lotta-Bots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365860/ed4bf7b8172f4edc426d4a7f7d7ee864fd32f097.jpg"},{"name"